    "lat": 19.13473,
    "lon": 72.83295,
    "name": "The Irish House, Andheri",
    "rating": 5,
    "text": "Ambience is pretty fantastic and the service is decent. Waiters are smart and professional and definitely ID all those who wish to indulge in a drink. The happy hours are a good deal and you can get the alcohol served in a casket, lending an Irish feel to the experience. Food is scrumptious although a tad bit costly.\nOverall would rate this place 8/10.",
    "month": "2019-06"
